SUMMARY:Ballroom Barre Workshop with Lori Woods-Gay
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n**Small group. Big
  improvement. Only 8 spots.**\n\n#### What's this all about?\n\nEver wish 
 your dancing just... clicked? Like your feet knew what to do without you h
 aving to think so hard about it?\nThat's exactly what this workshop is for
 . Lori's running her signature **Ballroom Barre Workshop** — we'll use a
  ballet barre to really drill the fundamentals of Ballroom & Smooth dancin
 g until they start to feel automatic. Less overthinking\, more flowing.\nI
 t's a **3-part series**\, not just a single class\, because muscle memory 
 takes a little repetition to stick. Come to all three and you'll actually 
 feel the difference by the end.\n\n#### Is this for you?\n\nProbably\, if 
 you:\n\n* Know the basics but want your moves to feel more natural\n* Are 
 working toward more advanced stuff and want a solid foundation first\n* Le
 ad OR follow — this helps both\n* Don't have a partner — no problem\, 
 come solo!\n\n#### When\n\n* Monday\, July 27\, 2026\n* Monday\, August 3\
 , 2026\n* Monday\, August 17\, 2026\n\n#### Where\n\nA Step To Gold Commun
 ity Ballroom\, Raleigh\, NC\n\n#### Heads up — only 8 spots\n\nLori keep
 s this one small so everyone gets real\, hands-on attention. It'll fill up
 \, so don't sit on this too long.\n\n#### What to bring\n\n* Shoes you can
  dance in comfortably\n* Water\n* Patience for repetition — trust the pr
 ocess!\n\n#### Grab your spot\n\n[https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ballroom-ba
 rre-workshop-with-lori-woods-gay-limited-to-8-students-tickets-19937969082
 24?aff=oddtdtcreator](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ballroom-barre-workshop
 -with-lori-woods-gay-limited-to-8-students-tickets-1993796908224?aff=oddtd
 tcreator)\nGot questions? Just drop a comment — happy to help!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-triangle-activities/events/31
 5788447/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260722T132418Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260722T132418Z
