SUMMARY:SALSA IN WHITE • AUGUST BIRTHDAY CELEBRATION ✨🤍
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🤍✨ SALSA IN W
 HITE • AUGUST BIRTHDAY CELEBRATION ✨🤍\n\nJoin us on Wednesday 8/5 f
 or one of our most elegant nights of the year as we celebrate all of our A
 ugust Birthday Stars with an unforgettable evening of dancing\, laughter\,
  great music\, and incredible company!\n\n🤍 Dress to Impress in WHITE a
 nd help us transform the dance floor into a sea of elegance and energy!\n
 ✨ Doors Open 7:15 PM – Meet & Greet Mixer\n🍹 Dance • Drink • Co
 nnect\n\n💃 Salsa & Bachata Lesson | 7:30–8:30 PM\nBeginner-friendly 
 • No partner needed\n\n🎁 Door Prizes\n🕺 Social Dancing | 8:30–11
 :30 PM\n🎧 DJ Giovanni spinning Salsa • Merengue • Bachata • Latin
  Hits 🔥\n\nCome dance\, celebrate\, and make new friends in one of the 
 Triangle's friendliest Latin dance communities!\n\n🎂 Special Birthday D
 ance & Celebration for all August birthdays\n🍻 Drink Specials • Spaci
 ous Dance Floor • Free Parking\n\n🤍 Attire: All White (or mostly whit
 e) is highly encouraged!\n❄️ Air-conditioned\n🪩 Spacious dance floo
 r\n🚗 Free parking\n🔥 Drink specials all night\n💲$10 Before 9 PM\n
 💲$15 After 9 PM\nEarly Bird Tickets at Salsa4Life.com\n\n🎉 Celebrati
 ng an August birthday? Send us a DM so we can feature you and make your ni
 ght extra special!\n\n🤍 Let's fill the room with WHITE\, celebrate life
 \, and dance the night away! 💃🕺✨\n\n📍 KōMANA Brewing Co. – 1
 020 Ryan Rd. Cary\, NC (Village Square Shopping Center)\n🔞 18+ to party
  | 21+ to drink\nGrab your friends and make Wednesdays your favorite night
  of the week! 💃🕺\n[Follow us on fb ](Facebook.com/salsa4lifenc)\nFol
 low us on fb Salsa4lifenc or instagram salsa4life_com
